  message: "Cross-item review 2026-05-17: edge-side analog of INV-sopon (Symbol-side missing-origin family). Per INV-sopon's per-file sibling enumeration, the 1 edge with BOTH origin AND origin_run_id empty (sw-register.ts → navigator.serviceWorker module_attr_ref) most likely comes from js-module-linker-v1's PASS_ID not being threaded to the edge constructor in that specific code path — the same shape as the Symbol-side omission in 19/21 linkers. Fix this and the parallel Symbol-side fix together for coherence."  # 21d9
